e\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">exprLin</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RingExpr\">RingExpr</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Grind.CommRing.Expr.lin_k e`: `exprDegB` with `|||` in place of the maximum.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.exprLin","kind":"def","line":47,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.exprLin","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.lean#L47-L54"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.exprDegB\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">exprDegB</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Types.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.RingExpr\">RingExpr</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The degree bound `Grind.CommRing.Expr.degB_k` of `e`.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.exprDegB","kind":"def","line":38,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.exprDegB","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.lean#L38-L45"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satPow\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">satPow</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">k</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`a ^ k`, or a value of at least `2 ^ kronSatBits` if `a ^ k` is larger. A saturated `a` stays\nsaturated even for `k = 0`: the kernel still computes the estimate of the base.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satPow","kind":"def","line":29,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satPow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.lean#L29-L36"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satMul\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">satMul</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">a </span><span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`a * b`, or a value of at least `2 ^ kronSatBits` if `a * b` is larger.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satMul","kind":"def","line":25,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.satMul","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.lean#L25-L27"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.kronSatBits\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">Arith</span>.<span class=\"name\">kronSatBits</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The estimates below saturate at `2 ^ kronSatBits`, which is larger than the bit limit of every\nKronecker certificate: an estimate that reaches it rejects the certificate (`kronExponent?`), and\nthe estimate is never computed in full. Without saturation, `((x - x) ^ 64) ^ 64 …` builds integers\nof billions of bits.","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.kronSatBits","kind":"def","line":17,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.kronSatBits","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/Arith/Kronecker.lean#L17-L23"}}],"imports":["Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.Types"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.Arith.Kronecker"}